<title>UK: Chelsea Village buys stake in travel group.</title>
<headline>Chelsea Village buys stake in travel group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chelsea Village Plc, owner of F.A. Cup winners Chelsea, said on Monday it had agreed to buy 80 percent of Bidglean Ltd for 2.3 million stg.</p>
<p>Chelsea agreed to a conditional contract to buy most of Bidglean Ltd, the holding company of a travel group.</p>
<p>Chelsea said it would make a further announcement once the contract became unconditional.</p>
<p>Chelsea beat Middlesborough 2-0 on Saturday to win the English F.A. Cup for the first time in 27 years.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
